  "description": "Shiyaaka Silver is a clean and elegant fragrance that blends bright citrus freshness with soft florals and smooth woody musk accords. The scent feels modern, refined, and versatile, making it an excellent everyday masculine fragrance with a polished designer-style character. The opening introduces bergamot, grapefruit, and fresh citrus notes, creating a crisp and energetic first impression with uplifting brightness. The heart develops into lavender, jasmine, and aromatic accords, adding smooth floral freshness balanced by masculine elegance and clean depth. The base settles into cedarwood, sandalwood, musk, and amber, leaving a soft woody trail that feels creamy, fresh, and long-lasting. Shiyaaka Silver is perfect for men who enjoy fresh woody fragrances with clean musky warmth and smooth everyday versatility.",
